### 공유 계정 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 공유 계정 상세 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 공유 계정 등록
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "GITHUB",
  "providerLabel": "팀 GitHub",
  "accountIdentifier": "cowork-bot",
  "credential": "ghp_example"
}

### 공유 계정 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerLabel": "팀 GitHub",
  "accountIdentifier": "cowork-bot",
  "credential": "ghp_example"
}

### 공유 계정 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 자격 증명 복사
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/accounts/1/credential/copy
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
